      "start_seconds": 1.36,
      "end_seconds": 4.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Hi there, the chair's free, sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.81,
      "end_seconds": 10.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Ah, um, afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.9,
      "end_seconds": 17.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.24,
      "end_seconds": 20.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Okay, what's the main thing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.03,
      "end_seconds": 29.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "Hmm, um, honestly, it's no symptoms, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.36,
      "end_seconds": 34.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.03,
      "end_seconds": 42.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Probably about three months. Yeah. I've also had slightly tired, since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.88,
      "end_seconds": 47.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.59,
      "end_seconds": 51.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "hmm, I'd call it severe"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.27,
      "end_seconds": 58.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "have you had a low blood count on a routine test?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.12,
      "end_seconds": 71.4,
      "duration_seconds": 12.28,
      "text": "Yeah, um, I've had that since Monday. Well, with low blood count on a routine test, moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.34,
      "end_seconds": 78.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Have you had no symptoms before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.81,
      "end_seconds": 87.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "ah, you know, yes, something like this happened last year, and it went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.38,
      "end_seconds": 93.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.73,
      "end_seconds": 105.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.25,
      "end_seconds": 107.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.78,
      "end_seconds": 122.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Your pulse and blood pressure are normal, and the eyelids are pale."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.59,
      "end_seconds": 132.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "you can relax now any black stools, heavy periods or blood in the stool at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.73,
      "end_seconds": 142.73,
      "duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "Well, you know, no, no black stools, heavy periods or blood in the stool."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.98,
      "end_seconds": 146.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Did you notice any weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.54,
      "end_seconds": 151.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "not at all, no weight loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.7,
      "end_seconds": 155.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.51,
      "end_seconds": 159.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.72,
      "end_seconds": 163.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.55,
      "end_seconds": 168.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Erm, nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.08,
      "end_seconds": 173.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "So, has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.61,
      "end_seconds": 178.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Uh, my father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.73,
      "end_seconds": 180.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.22,
      "end_seconds": 185.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "nothing, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.85,
      "end_seconds": 194.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.38,
      "end_seconds": 200.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Yes, amoxicillin, it gives me hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.74,
      "end_seconds": 206.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.99,
      "end_seconds": 222.19,
      "duration_seconds": 14.2,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. No, I share a house with my brother. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I retired from the post office two years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.94,
      "end_seconds": 228.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.44,
      "end_seconds": 237.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "it's warfarin, 3 milligrams, in the evening. It's, It's sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.83,
      "end_seconds": 240.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Is that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.72,
      "end_seconds": 246.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "About three months now. Ibuprofen, most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.46,
      "end_seconds": 249.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.32,
      "end_seconds": 255.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "400 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.39,
      "end_seconds": 274.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.09,
      "end_seconds": 294.89,
      "duration_seconds": 18.8,
      "text": "Uh, I've had an irregular heartbeat for about ten years now. I have migraines, for five years. I took the morning off to come in today. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.61,
      "end_seconds": 308.78,
      "duration_seconds": 13.17,
      "text": "Sure. Alright, an irregular heartbeat and migraines, that that matches what I have here. Let me tell you where I've got to. This looks most like iron-deficiency anaemia needing a source found."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.43,
      "end_seconds": 351.26,
      "duration_seconds": 32.83,
      "text": "A coeliac blood test is what I'd like next, for anaemia. I want a camera test of the stomach and bowel done, that's for iron-deficiency anaemia. I want an iron study done, that's for anaemia. I'm going to put you on ferrous sulfate, 200 milligrams, once a day, three months. You take it by mouth. It's for iron deficiency. Stop the ibuprofen and we will refer you for scopes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.21,
      "end_seconds": 359.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "The lower GI team would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.68,
      "end_seconds": 364.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Oh, sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.64,
      "end_seconds": 373.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "text": "Let's review you after the tests. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.41,
      "end_seconds": 380.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "let me think, um, I think I understand everything thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
